<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
  <meta charset="UTF-8">
  <meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1.0">
  <meta name="robots" content="noindex">
  <title><%= title %></title>
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="32x32" href="/img/favicon-32.png">
  <link rel="icon" type="image/png" sizes="64x64" href="/img/favicon-64.png">
  <link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/img/favicon-180.png">
  <style>
    * { margin: 0; padding: 0; box-sizing: border-box; }
    :root { --bg:#0a0a0c; --line:rgba(255,255,255,.1); --line-2:rgba(255,255,255,.18); --text:#e8e8ec; --muted:#9d9da8; --soft:#6f6f7a; --red:#e11d2a; --red-deep:#a60f1a; --gold:#f5b301; }
    html, body { height: 100%; }
    body { font-family:-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,'Segoe UI',Roboto,Arial,sans-serif; background:var(--bg); color:var(--text);
      display:flex; align-items:center; justify-content:center; padding:24px; position:relative; }
    body::before { content:""; position:absolute; inset:0; z-index:0;
      background: radial-gradient(ellipse 55% 45% at 15% 10%, rgba(225,29,42,.13), transparent 60%),
                  radial-gradient(ellipse 45% 40% at 88% 90%, rgba(245,179,1,.07), transparent 60%); }
    /* Vignette reveal: desaturated, dimmed photo visible only at the edges —
       a somber "paused" mood, distinct from the other auth pages' treatments. */
    body::after { content:""; position:absolute; inset:0; z-index:0;
      background: url('/img/road-skyline.jpeg') center 45% / cover no-repeat;
      filter: grayscale(.5) brightness(.5); opacity: .3;
      -webkit-mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 58% 55% at 50% 48%, transparent 30%, #000 88%);
              mask-image: radial-gradient(ellipse 58% 55% at 50% 48%, transparent 30%, #000 88%); }
    .card { position:relative; z-index:1; width:100%; max-width:440px; padding:42px 38px 34px; text-align:center;
      background: linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(28,28,34,.86), rgba(16,16,20,.92));
      border:1px solid var(--line-2); border-radius:20px; backdrop-filter:blur(18px); box-shadow:0 30px 80px rgba(0,0,0,.55); }
    .card::before { content:""; position:absolute; top:0; left:22px; right:22px; height:2px; border-radius:999px;
      background: linear-gradient(90deg, transparent, var(--red), var(--gold), transparent); }
    .lockup { display:inline-flex; align-items:center; gap:12px; margin-bottom:24px; }
    .mark { width:42px; height:42px; display:grid; place-items:center; }
    .mark img { width: 100%; height: 100%; object-fit: contain; filter: drop-shadow(0 8px 18px rgba(37,99,235,.45)); }
    .wordmark { font-weight:900; color:#fff; font-size:18px; letter-spacing:-.3px; text-align:left; line-height:1; }
    .wordmark b { color:var(--red); }
    .wordmark small { display:block; font-size:9.5px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:1.4px; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--soft); margin-top:4px; }
    .pause-icon { width:58px; height:58px; margin:0 auto 18px; border-radius:50%; display:grid; place-items:center;
      background:rgba(245,179,1,.1); border:1.5px solid rgba(245,179,1,.4); }
    .pause-icon svg { width:26px; height:26px; color:var(--gold); }
    h1 { font-size:25px; font-weight:800; letter-spacing:-.4px; color:#fff; }
    p { margin-top:12px; font-size:14px; line-height:1.65; color:var(--muted); }
    p strong { color:var(--text); }
    p a { color:var(--gold); font-weight:700; text-decoration:none; }
    .out { display:inline-block; margin-top:24px; padding:12px 26px; font-size:13.5px; font-weight:800; color:#fff; text-decoration:none;
      background:linear-gradient(135deg,var(--red),var(--red-deep)); border-radius:10px; box-shadow:0 12px 30px rgba(225,29,42,.4); }
    .foot { margin-top:24px; padding-top:18px; border-top:1px solid var(--line); font-size:10.5px; font-weight:700; letter-spacing:1px; text-transform:uppercase; color:var(--soft); }
  </style>
</head>
<body>
  <main class="card">
    <div class="lockup">
      <span class="mark"><img src="/img/logo-fleetshq-icon.png" alt=""></span>
      <span class="wordmark">FLEETS<b>.</b>HQ<small>One platform. Total control.</small></span>
    </div>
    <div class="pause-icon" aria-hidden="true">
      <svg fill="none" viewBox="0 0 24 24" stroke="currentColor" stroke-width="2"><path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" d="M15.75 5.25v13.5m-7.5-13.5v13.5"/></svg>
    </div>
    <h1>Subscription paused</h1>
    <p>Your organisation's FLEETS.HQ environment is currently <strong>paused</strong>. All of your data is safe and nothing has been deleted &mdash; access resumes the moment the subscription is reactivated.</p>
    <p>If you're the account administrator, email <a href="mailto:alerts@fleetshq.com">alerts@fleetshq.com</a> to reactivate. Otherwise, please contact your administrator.</p>
    <a class="out" href="/billing">Renew licence</a>
    <a class="out" href="/logout" style="background:none;border:1px solid var(--line-2);box-shadow:none;margin-left:8px;color:var(--muted)">Sign out</a>
    <div class="foot">FLEETS.HQ</div>
  </main>
</body>
</html>
